A photorealistic aerial photograph capturing thousands of smartphones, tablets, and small computing devices scattered across the golden savanna of Kenya at sunset, each device glowing with soft blue light and connected by thin luminous threads forming an intricate web pattern that hovers just above the grass. The devices appear to move together like a murmuration of starlings, creating organic flowing patterns against the dramatic orange and purple sky. In the background, acacia trees silhouette against the horizon while the collective glow of the connected devices creates an ethereal mist rising upward, suggesting distributed intelligence emerging from countless small nodes working in harmony.
